{"id":"ccbc12:problem:f-p1817","answer":"LIQUID CRYSTAL DISPLAY","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每一个小色块的RGB值都是线性变化的，试着把所有色块的颜色在同一个空间里表示出来？</p>","text":"每一个小色块的RGB值都是线性变化的，试着把所有色块的颜色在同一个空间里表示出来？","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>R-G平面、G-B平面、B-R平面分别对应一个单词，按照顺序连在一起。</p>","text":"R-G平面、G-B平面、B-R平面分别对应一个单词，按照顺序连在一起。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>题面图片被分成七行，每行又被均匀分割成若干块色块。通过提取RGB值，发现每一个色块的颜色变化都是线性的，于是考虑将所有色块的RGB值画在三个坐标系上（每一个色块对应一条线段）。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-81e57629658197452e423b5e\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-1.png\"/></p>\n<p>通过三视图象形得到三个词，连起来得到答案：<strong>LIQUID CRYSTAL DISPLAY</strong>。</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-e8f54d3104cb78434714fbaf\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-2.gif\"/></p>\n<p>每一行颜色在三个词里分别对应一个字母</p>\n<p>除了第一个词中有两个U叠在一起</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-498e2406290e0ff4fa7c37f0\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-3.png\"/></p>\n<p>你还可以查看视频题解： https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fg411e7hM</p>","text":"题面图片被分成七行，每行又被均匀分割成若干块色块。通过提取RGB值，发现每一个色块的颜色变化都是线性的，于是考虑将所有色块的RGB值画在三个坐标系上（每一个色块对应一条线段）。\n\n通过三视图象形得到三个词，连起来得到答案：\nLIQUID CRYSTAL DISPLAY\n。\n\n每一行颜色在三个词里分别对应一个字母\n\n除了第一个词中有两个U叠在一起\n\n你还可以查看视频题解： https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fg411e7hM","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-498e2406290e0ff4fa7c37f0","asset-81e57629658197452e423b5e","asset-e8f54d3104cb78434714fbaf"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-498e2406290e0ff4fa7c37f0","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-3.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-3.png","mime":"image/png","size":19623,"sha256":"4603a30a27b3c4ef5aad18c00bccda8d5fd0d704aec6e2a49bd94ff326f7bfc6","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-81e57629658197452e423b5e","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-1.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-1.png","mime":"image/png","size":115141,"sha256":"d38a2156e2372e0f5d6ff9b89846646f396297f434ff0fa8257383d3672877d9","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-e8f54d3104cb78434714fbaf","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-2.gif","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/f-1817-2.gif","mime":"image/gif","size":2337598,"sha256":"bd60ece66edca1c3a45936f1566d7485ceff21c016e5ba9a6124561504a0e218","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
